nd five years: and he died.", "words": [[0, 65782], [4, 65896], [8, 66196], [12, 66396], [17, 66756], [20, 66956], [25, 67356], [30, 67612], [35, 67868], [43, 68124], [47, 68380], [52, 68636], [59, 69724], [63, 69865], [66, 69965]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 70951, "end": 74038, "text": "¶ And Cainan lived seventy years, and begot Mahalaleel:", "words": [[2, 70951], [6, 71196], [13, 71476], [19, 71816], [27, 72156], [34, 72616], [38, 72816], [44, 73446]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 74488, "end": 80655, "text": "And Cainan lived after he begot Mahalaleel eight hundred and forty years, and begot sons and daughters:", "words": [[0, 74488], [4, 74748], [11, 75038], [17, 75338], [23, 75658], [26, 75838], [32, 76178], [43, 76518], [49, 76858], [57, 77198], [61, 77538], [67, 77878], [74, 78358], [78, 78998], [84, 79338], [89, 79678], [93, 79998]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 81105, "end": 85605, "text": "And all the days of Cainan were nine hundred and ten years: and he died.", "words": [[0, 81105], [4, 81268], [8, 81468], [12, 81648], [17, 81948], [20, 82248], [27, 82548], [32, 82756], [37, 82964], [45, 83172], [49, 83380], [53, 83588], [60, 84744], [64, 84889], [67, 85009]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 86055, "end": 89897, "text": "¶ And Mahalaleel lived sixty and five years, and begot Jared:", "words": [[2, 86055], [6, 86456], [17, 86896], [23, 87256], [29, 87616], [33, 87846], [38, 88076], [45, 88476], [49, 88876], [55, 89316]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 90347, "end": 97082, "text": "And Mahalaleel lived after he begot Jared eight hundred and thirty years, and begot sons and daughters:", "words": [[0, 90347], [4, 90708], [15, 91098], [21, 91398], [27, 91738], [30, 91918], [36, 92318], [42, 92598], [48, 92878], [56, 93158], [60, 93438], [67, 93718], [74, 94178], [78, 94678], [84, 95038], [89, 95398], [93, 95658]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 97532, "end": 102552, "text": "And all the days of Mahalaleel were eight hundred ninety and five years: and he died.", "words": [[0, 97532], [4, 9765